    "text": "Two vehicles, each moving with speed u on&nbsp; the same horizontal straight road, are approaching each other. Wind blows along the road with velocity w. One of these vehicles blows a whistle of frequency f<sub>1</sub>. An observer in the other vehicle hears the frequency of the whistle to be f<sub>2</sub>. The speed of sound in still air is V. The correct statement (s) is (are) :"
